P2 (design §4.3): the locale archive is looked up in $LOCALE_ARCHIVE_2_27,
then $LOCALE_ARCHIVE (secure_getenv: ignored for setuid programs), then --
inherited unchanged from nixpkgs -- /run/current-system/sw/lib/locale/locale-archive
(NixOS) and /usr/lib/locale/locale-archive (FHS host), then the compiled-in
$prefix/lib/locale/locale-archive.  The archive (glibc-all-langpacks) is a
separate output, so the compiled-in path is not where it lives
(runtimeSearchPaths: LOCALE_ARCHIVE).
Rebased from nixpkgs 26f4107e47e3 pkgs/development/libraries/glibc/nix-locale-archive.patch
onto Rocky glibc-2.39-142.el10_2 after %prep; same changes, no others.

